<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>جمعية إرث وحضارة بالقريات</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Elegant Arabic & Latin -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Almarai:wght@300;400;700;800&family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Font Awesome 6 (free icons) -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        /* ========== GLOBAL STYLES & PREMIUM RESET ========== */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--c-bg, #ffffff);
            font-family: 'Almarai', 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            line-height: 1.5;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .site-wrapper {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem 2rem 0;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        /* ========== PREMIUM NAVBAR ========== */
        .nav-container {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 200;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            padding: var(--sp-3, 0.8rem) 0 var(--sp-4, 1.5rem);
            gap: var(--sp-4, 2rem);
            height: auto;
            background: var(--c-glass, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72));
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(160%);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(160%);
            margin-bottom: var(--sp-6, 2rem);
            border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
            transition: border-color var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out), box-shadow var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out);
        }

        .nav-container.scrolled {
            border-bottom-color: var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08));
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs, 0 1px 3px rgba(20, 16, 8, 0.04));
        }
        .logo-area-nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .nav-logo-img {
            height: 52px;
            width: auto;
            object-fit: contain;
            display: block;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .association-name-nav {
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }
        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .nav-links a {
            position: relative;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--c-text-secondary, #5a5650);
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.93rem;
            transition: color var(--dur-fast, 180ms) var(--ease-out);
            padding: 6px 2px;
        }

        .nav-links a::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            border-radius: var(--r-pill, 100px);
            transition: width var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-spring);
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
        }

        .nav-links a:hover::after {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .nav-links a.active {
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .nav-links a.active::after {
            width: 100%;
        }
        /* Employee Portal link — subtle gold pill */
        .nav-links a.nav-portal-link {
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            font-weight: 700;
            border: 1px solid rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.4);
            border-radius: 100px;
            padding: 5px 14px 6px;
            background: rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.06);
            transition: all var(--dur-fast, 180ms) var(--ease-out);
        }
        .nav-links a.nav-portal-link:hover {
            color: #fff;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b8883e, #d4a855);
            border-color: #b8883e;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px -6px rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.5);
        }

        /* ========== FOOTER ========== */
        .footer-premium {
            margin-top: 5rem;
            padding: 2rem 0 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08));
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--c-text-muted, #8a8478);
        }

        /* ========== SHARED CARD & BUTTON STYLES ========== */
        .section-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .section-title:after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -12px;
            right: 0;
            width: 60px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
        }
        .grid-2cols, .grid-3cols {
            display: grid;
            gap: 2rem;
        }
        .grid-2cols { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
        .grid-3cols { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); }
        @media (max-width: 850px) {
            .grid-2cols, .grid-3cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .nav-container { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
            .site-wrapper { padding: 1rem; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .nav-links { gap: 0.55rem 0.9rem; row-gap: 0.4rem; }
            .nav-links a { font-size: 0.82rem; }
            .association-name-nav { font-size: 1.1rem; }
            .nav-logo-img { height: 42px; }
        }
        .elegant-card {
            background: var(--c-surface, #ffffff);
            border: 1px solid var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08));
            border-radius: var(--r-md, 16px);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            transition: all var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-spring);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }
        .elegant-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            border-color: var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
            background: var(--c-surface-2, #fbfaf8);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }
        .btn-heritage {
            display: inline-block;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            padding: 0.6rem 1.8rem;
            border-radius: var(--r-pill, 100px);
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .btn-heritage:hover {
            background: var(--c-gold-pale, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.12));
            border-color: var(--c-gold-soft, #d4a855);
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* ========== HERO — CENTERED CLEAN DESIGN ========== */
        .hero-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--sp-9, 5rem) 0 var(--sp-8, 4rem);
            border-radius: var(--r-lg, 22px);
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: var(--sp-9, 5rem);
            background: var(--c-surface, #ffffff);
            border: 1px solid var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08));
        }

        .hero-wrapper::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(var(--c-border-soft, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.05)) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, var(--c-border-soft, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.05)) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 56px 56px;
            -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 50% 0%, #000 30%, transparent 80%);
            mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 50% 0%, #000 30%, transparent 80%);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero-wrapper::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: -160px;
            right: -120px;
            width: 480px;
            height: 480px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--c-gold-pale, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.12)) 0%, transparent 70%);
            filter: blur(40px);
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .hero-editorial-text {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            max-width: 760px;
            padding: 0 var(--sp-4, 2rem);
        }

        .hero-ornament-line {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: var(--sp-5, 2.2rem);
            opacity: 0;
            animation: heroFadeUp 1s ease 0.2s forwards;
        }
        .hero-ornament-line::before,
        .hero-ornament-line::after {
            content: "";
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 80px;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
        }
        .hero-ornament-diamond {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .hero-eyebrow {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.16em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: var(--sp-4, 1.4rem);
            opacity: 0;
            animation: heroFadeUp 1s ease 0.4s forwards;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: var(--c-glass, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72));
            padding: 7px 16px;
            border: 1px solid var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08));
            border-radius: var(--r-pill, 100px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs);
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.25;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            margin-bottom: var(--sp-4, 1.6rem);
            opacity: 0;
            animation: heroFadeUp 1s ease 0.6s forwards;
        }
        .hero-title em {
            font-style: normal;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--c-gold, #b8883e) 0%, var(--c-gold-soft, #d4a855) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.62em;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }

        .hero-sub {
            font-size: 1.02rem;
            line-height: 1.9;
            color: var(--c-text-secondary, #5a5650);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-bottom: var(--sp-6, 2.8rem);
            opacity: 0;
            animation: heroFadeUp 1s ease 0.8s forwards;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .hero-cta-group {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1.8rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: heroFadeUp 1s ease 1s forwards;
        }
        .hero-cta-primary {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            background: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            color: var(--c-surface, #ffffff);
            border: none;
            padding: 0.85rem 2.2rem;
            border-radius: var(--r-sm, 10px);
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-family: 'Almarai', sans-serif;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            transition: background var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out), transform var(--dur-fast, 180ms) var(--ease-out);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }
        .hero-cta-primary:hover {
            background: var(--c-text-secondary, #5a5650);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
        }
        .hero-cta-secondary {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            text-decoration: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
            padding-bottom: 2px;
            transition: color var(--dur-fast, 180ms) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-fast, 180ms) var(--ease-out);
            font-family: 'Almarai', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .hero-cta-secondary:hover {
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            border-color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
        }

        .hero-meta-strip {
            display: none;
        }

        .hero-visual-panel {
            display: none;
        }

        .hero-frame-overlay {
            display: none;
        }

        .hero-visual-bg {
            display: none;
        }

        .hero-image {
            display: none;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: none;
        }

        .hero-year-stamp {
            display: none;
        }

        @keyframes heroFadeUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); }
            to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        @keyframes heroPanelReveal {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1.06); }
            to   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
        }
        @keyframes heroDrift {
            0%   { transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
            50%  { transform: scale(1.03) translateY(-8px); }
            100% { transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
        }
        .hero-visual-animated {
            animation: heroDrift 14s ease-in-out infinite;
            transform-origin: center;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .hero-wrapper {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                min-height: auto;
                padding: 3rem 2rem 2.5rem;
                margin-bottom: 3rem;
            }
            .hero-editorial-text {
                padding: 0;
                order: 2;
            }
            .hero-title { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5.5vw, 2.8rem); }
            .hero-eyebrow { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero-wrapper {
                padding: 2.2rem 1.4rem 2rem;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }
            .hero-sub { font-size: 0.92rem; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.75; }
            .hero-cta-group { gap: 0.8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
            .hero-title { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 7vw, 2.4rem); }
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .hero-eyebrow { font-size: 0.7rem; }
            .hero-title { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 2rem); }
        }

        /* ========== VISION & MISSION ========== */
        .vm-section {
            position: relative;
            margin: 0 0 4rem;
            padding: 5rem 0;
        }

        .vm-section::before,
        .vm-section::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            right: 0;
            left: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg,
                transparent 0%,
                var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08)) 20%,
                var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08)) 50%,
                var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08)) 80%,
                transparent 100%);
        }
        .vm-section::before { top: 0; }
        .vm-section::after  { bottom: 0; }

        .vm-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }
        .vm-header-eyebrow {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.26em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .vm-header-rule {
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08));
        }
        .vm-header-diamond {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .vm-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        .vm-grid::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 10%;
            bottom: 10%;
            right: 50%;
            width: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(
                to bottom,
                transparent,
                rgba(192, 154, 98, 0.35) 25%,
                rgba(192, 154, 98, 0.35) 75%,
                transparent
            );
        }

        .vm-panel {
            padding: 3rem 4rem;
            position: relative;
        }
        .vm-panel:first-child {
            padding-right: 3rem;
            padding-left: 4rem;
        }
        .vm-panel:last-child {
            padding-right: 4rem;
            padding-left: 3rem;
        }

        .vm-panel-numeral {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 7rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1;
            color: var(--c-gold-pale, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.12));
            position: absolute;
            top: 1.5rem;
            left: 3rem;
            pointer-events: none;
            user-select: none;
            letter-spacing: -0.05em;
        }
        .vm-panel:first-child .vm-panel-numeral {
            right: 3rem;
            left: auto;
        }

        .vm-tag {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.62rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
        }
        .vm-tag::before {
            content: "";
            width: 20px;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .vm-title {
            font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2.4vw, 2.4rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            line-height: 1.2;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            position: relative;
        }
        .vm-title::after {
            content: "";
            display: block;
            width: 36px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            margin-top: 1.2rem;
        }

        .vm-body {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 2;
            color: var(--c-text-secondary, #5a5650);
            font-weight: 300;
            max-width: 38ch;
        }

        .vm-pullquote {
            margin: 2.4rem 0 0;
            padding: 1.4rem 1.8rem;
            border-right: 2px solid var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
            background: var(--c-surface-2, #fbfaf8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            border-radius: var(--r-sm, 10px);
        }
        .vm-pullquote p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.9;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            font-weight: 400;
        }
        .vm-pullquote cite {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 0.8rem;
            font-size: 0.68rem;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            font-style: normal;
        }

        .vm-panel-ornament {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            opacity: 0.45;
        }
        .vm-panel-ornament::before {
            content: "";
            width: 28px;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
        }
        .vm-panel-ornament-dot {
            width: 4px;
            height: 4px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
        }
        .vm-panel-ornament::after {
            content: "";
            width: 14px;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .vm-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .vm-grid::after { display: none; }
            .vm-panel,
            .vm-panel:first-child,
            .vm-panel:last-child {
                padding: 2.5rem 1.6rem;
            }
            .vm-panel-numeral { display: none; }
            .vm-panel:first-child::after {
                content: "";
                display: block;
                height: 1px;
                background: linear-gradient(90deg,
                    rgba(192,154,98,0.4), transparent);
                margin-top: 2.5rem;
            }
            .vm-section { padding: 3.5rem 0; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 540px) {
            .vm-body { max-width: 100%; font-size: 0.95rem; }
            .vm-title { font-size: 1.6rem; }
            .vm-panel,
            .vm-panel:first-child,
            .vm-panel:last-child { padding: 2rem 1.2rem; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .vm-title { font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 6vw, 1.7rem); }
            .vm-section { padding: 3rem 0; }
        }

        /* ========== OBJECTIVES SECTION ========== */
        .obj-section {
            position: relative;
            padding: 5rem 0;
            margin: 0 0 4rem;
        }
        .obj-section::before,
        .obj-section::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            right: 0; left: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg,
                transparent 0%,
                var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08)) 20%,
                var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08)) 50%,
                var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08)) 80%,
                transparent 100%);
        }
        .obj-section::before { top: 0; }
        .obj-section::after  { bottom: 0; }

        .obj-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
        }
        .obj-header-eyebrow {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.26em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .obj-header-rule {
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08));
        }
        .obj-header-diamond {
            width: 6px; height: 6px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .obj-heading {
            font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.2vw, 2.2rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            letter-spacing: -0.025em;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            position: relative;
        }
        .obj-heading::after {
            content: "";
            display: block;
            width: 36px; height: 2px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            margin-top: 1.1rem;
        }

        .obj-grid {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1.4rem;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .obj-item {
            flex: 0 1 calc((100% - 2.8rem) / 3);
            min-width: 220px;
            background: var(--c-surface, #ffffff);
            border: 1px solid var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08));
            border-radius: var(--r-md, 16px);
            padding: 2rem 1.8rem 1.6rem;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: background var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out), transform var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out);
        }
        .obj-item:hover {
            background: var(--c-surface-2, #fbfaf8);
            border-color: var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        /* Faint large numeral watermark */
        .obj-numeral {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 6.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1;
            color: var(--c-gold-pale, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.12));
            position: absolute;
            top: 0.8rem;
            left: 1.2rem;
            pointer-events: none;
            user-select: none;
            letter-spacing: -0.05em;
        }

        /* Circular gold badge */
        .obj-badge {
            width: 38px; height: 38px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
            background: var(--c-surface, #ffffff);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            transition: border-color var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out);
        }
        .obj-item:hover .obj-badge { border-color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e); }

        .obj-text {
            font-size: 0.93rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            line-height: 1.7;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        /* Bottom ornament */
        .obj-foot {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
            margin-top: 1.4rem;
            opacity: 0.38;
        }
        .obj-foot::before {
            content: "";
            width: 22px; height: 1px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
        }
        .obj-foot-dot {
            width: 3px; height: 3px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
        }

        @media (max-width: 860px) {
            .obj-item { flex-basis: calc((100% - 1.4rem) / 2); }
        }
        @media (max-width: 540px) {
            .obj-item { flex-basis: 100%; min-width: unset; }
            .obj-section { padding: 3.5rem 0; }
            .obj-numeral { font-size: 5rem; }
        }

        /* ========== HOMEPAGE ACTIVITIES PREVIEW ========== */
        .hp-activities-preview {
            margin: 4rem 0 5rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hp-activities-preview::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; right: 0; left: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg,
                transparent 0%,
                rgba(192,154,98,0.2) 20%,
                rgba(192,154,98,0.45) 50%,
                rgba(192,154,98,0.2) 80%,
                transparent 100%);
        }

        .hp-acts-header {
            padding-top: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .hp-acts-eyebrow-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
        }

        .hp-acts-eyebrow {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.6rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.24em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #a07848;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .hp-acts-rule {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 100px;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(192,154,98,0.5), transparent);
        }

        .hp-acts-diamond {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background: #c09a62;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .hp-acts-title {
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .hp-acts-title::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            right: 0;
            width: 50px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
        }

        .hp-acts-desc {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.9;
            color: var(--c-text-secondary, #5a5650);
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-top: 1.4rem;
            max-width: 480px;
        }

        /* Two-card grid for events preview */
        .hp-acts-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        .hp-act-card {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            background: var(--c-surface, #ffffff);
            border: 1px solid var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08));
            border-radius: var(--r-md, 16px);
            overflow: hidden;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            transition: transform var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-spring),
                        box-shadow var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-spring),
                        border-color var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .hp-act-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            border-color: var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        .hp-act-card-img-wrap {
            position: relative;
            aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
            min-height: 160px;
            max-height: 300px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #1e1208;
        }

        .hp-act-card-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            transition: transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1);
        }

        .hp-act-card:hover .hp-act-card-img {
            transform: scale(1.06);
        }

        .hp-act-card-img-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to top,
                rgba(12,7,2,0.55) 0%,
                transparent 55%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .hp-act-card-num {
            position: absolute;
            top: 1rem;
            right: 1rem;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.58rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            color: rgba(235,210,175,0.7);
            background: rgba(15,8,2,0.38);
            backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
            border-radius: 40px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(192,154,98,0.2);
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .hp-act-card-body {
            padding: 1.5rem 1.6rem 1.8rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .hp-act-card-tag {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.58rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
        }

        .hp-act-card-name {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            letter-spacing: -0.015em;
            line-height: 1.25;
        }

        .hp-act-card-desc {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--c-text-secondary, #5a5650);
            font-weight: 300;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .hp-act-card-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-top: 0.6rem;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
            padding-bottom: 2px;
            align-self: flex-start;
            transition: color var(--dur-fast, 180ms) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-fast, 180ms) var(--ease-out);
        }

        .hp-act-card:hover .hp-act-card-link {
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            border-color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
        }

        .hp-act-card-link i { font-size: 0.7rem; }

        .hp-acts-cta-row {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .hp-acts-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.2rem; }
            .hp-acts-header { padding-top: 3rem; }
            .hp-act-card-name { font-size: 1.1rem; }
            .hp-act-card-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; }
        }

        /* ========== HERITAGE & CRAFTS PREVIEW SECTION ========== */
        .hp-heritage-preview {
            margin: 0 0 5rem;
            position: relative;
            padding-top: 5rem;
        }

        .hp-heritage-preview::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; right: 0; left: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg,
                transparent 0%,
                rgba(192,154,98,0.2) 20%,
                rgba(192,154,98,0.45) 50%,
                rgba(192,154,98,0.2) 80%,
                transparent 100%);
        }

        .hp-heritage-header {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .hp-heritage-eyebrow-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
        }

        .hp-heritage-eyebrow {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.6rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.24em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #a07848;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .hp-heritage-rule {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 100px;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(192,154,98,0.5), transparent);
        }

        .hp-heritage-diamond {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background: #c09a62;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .hp-heritage-title {
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .hp-heritage-title::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            right: 0;
            width: 50px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
        }

        .hp-heritage-desc {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.9;
            color: var(--c-text-secondary, #5a5650);
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-top: 1.4rem;
            max-width: 520px;
        }

        /* ========== Horizontal scroll track ========== */
        .hp-heritage-track-wrap {
            position: relative;
            margin: 0 -1.5rem 2.4rem;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
        }

        .hp-heritage-track {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.6rem;
            overflow-x: auto;
            scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            padding: 0.6rem 0 1.6rem;
            cursor: grab;
            -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
            scrollbar-width: none;
        }
        .hp-heritage-track::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
        .hp-heritage-track.is-dragging { cursor: grabbing; scroll-snap-type: none; }
        .hp-heritage-track.is-dragging .hp-hcard { pointer-events: none; }

        /* Reveal stagger for cards */
        .hp-heritage-track .hp-hcard {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(36px);
            transition: opacity 0.7s var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)),
                        transform 0.7s var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)),
                        box-shadow var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-spring),
                        border-color var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out);
        }
        .hp-heritage-track.revealed .hp-hcard {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
        .hp-heritage-track.revealed .hp-hcard:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0.05s; }
        .hp-heritage-track.revealed .hp-hcard:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 0.16s; }
        .hp-heritage-track.revealed .hp-hcard:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 0.27s; }
        .hp-heritage-track.revealed .hp-hcard:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: 0.38s; }

        /* Heritage card — museum-style horizontal card */
        .hp-hcard {
            position: relative;
            flex: 0 0 auto;
            width: min(78vw, 360px);
            scroll-snap-align: start;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            background: var(--c-surface, #ffffff);
            border: 1px solid var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08));
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
            will-change: transform;
        }

        .hp-hcard:hover,
        .hp-hcard:focus-visible {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
            box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -12px rgba(20, 16, 8, 0.18);
        }

        .hp-hcard-img-wrap {
            position: relative;
            aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #efe6d6, #e3d6bd);
        }

        .hp-hcard-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 112%;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            transform: translateY(-2%) scale(1.04);
            transition: transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1);
        }

        .hp-hcard:hover .hp-hcard-img {
            transform: translateY(-2%) scale(1.12);
        }

        .hp-hcard-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to top,
                rgba(28, 18, 6, 0.78) 0%,
                rgba(28, 18, 6, 0.18) 46%,
                rgba(28, 18, 6, 0) 75%);
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: background 0.4s var(--ease-out, ease);
        }

        /* Text-only card (no image) — "ما هي الحرفة؟" */
        .hp-hcard-text-only {
            justify-content: center;
            background: linear-gradient(155deg, #faf6ee 0%, #f3ead9 100%);
            border-color: rgba(192, 154, 98, 0.28);
        }

        .hp-hcard-text-only:hover,
        .hp-hcard-text-only:focus-visible {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            box-shadow: 0 24px 48px -12px rgba(20, 16, 8, 0.16);
        }

        .hp-hcard-text-mark {
            padding: 1.6rem 1.7rem 0;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.35);
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .hp-hcard-text-only .hp-hcard-body {
            padding-top: 0.6rem;
            gap: 0.8rem;
        }

        .hp-hcard-text-only .hp-hcard-name {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }

        .hp-hcard-text-only .hp-hcard-desc {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 2;
            -webkit-line-clamp: 6;
        }

        .hp-hcard-body {
            position: relative;
            padding: 1.5rem 1.7rem 1.9rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.55rem;
        }

        .hp-hcard-name {
            font-size: 1.18rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            letter-spacing: -0.015em;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .hp-hcard-desc {
            font-size: 0.86rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--c-text-secondary, #5a5650);
            font-weight: 300;
            display: -webkit-box;
            -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
            -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Scroll progress bar */
        .hp-heritage-progress {
            position: relative;
            height: 2px;
            margin: 0 0.2rem;
            background: rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.07);
            border-radius: 2px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .hp-heritage-progress-fill {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; right: 0;
            height: 100%;
            width: 25%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--c-gold, #b8883e), var(--c-gold-soft, #d4a855));
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: width 0.25s var(--ease-out, ease);
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .hp-heritage-track-wrap { margin: 0 -1.1rem 2rem; padding: 0 1.1rem; }
            .hp-hcard { width: 82vw; }
            .hp-hcard-name { font-size: 1.08rem; }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .hp-heritage-track .hp-hcard,
            .hp-hcard-img,
            .hp-hcard:hover .hp-hcard-img {
                transition: none !important;
                transform: none !important;
                opacity: 1 !important;
            }
        }

        /* ========== VOLUNTEER PREVIEW SECTION ========== */
        .hp-volunteer-preview {
            margin: 0 0 5rem;
            position: relative;
            padding-top: 5rem;
        }

        .hp-volunteer-preview::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; right: 0; left: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg,
                transparent 0%,
                rgba(192,154,98,0.2) 20%,
                rgba(192,154,98,0.45) 50%,
                rgba(192,154,98,0.2) 80%,
                transparent 100%);
        }

        .hp-volunteer-header {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .hp-volunteer-eyebrow-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
        }

        .hp-volunteer-eyebrow {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.6rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.24em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #a07848;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .hp-volunteer-rule {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 100px;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(192,154,98,0.5), transparent);
        }

        .hp-volunteer-diamond {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background: #c09a62;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .hp-volunteer-title {
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .hp-volunteer-title::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            right: 0;
            width: 50px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
        }

        .hp-volunteer-desc {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.9;
            color: var(--c-text-secondary, #5a5650);
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-top: 1.4rem;
            max-width: 480px;
        }

        /* ========== Horizontal scroll track (shares .hp-hcard styles with heritage) ========== */
        .hp-volunteer-track-wrap {
            position: relative;
            margin: 0 -1.5rem 0;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
        }

        .hp-volunteer-track {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.6rem;
            overflow-x: auto;
            scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            padding: 0.6rem 0 1.6rem;
            cursor: grab;
            -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
            scrollbar-width: none;
        }
        .hp-volunteer-track::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
        .hp-volunteer-track.is-dragging { cursor: grabbing; scroll-snap-type: none; }
        .hp-volunteer-track.is-dragging .hp-hcard { pointer-events: none; }

        /* Reveal stagger for cards */
        .hp-volunteer-track .hp-hcard {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(36px);
            transition: opacity 0.7s var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)),
                        transform 0.7s var(--ease-out, cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)),
                        box-shadow var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-spring),
                        border-color var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out);
        }
        .hp-volunteer-track.revealed .hp-hcard {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
        .hp-volunteer-track.revealed .hp-hcard:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0.05s; }
        .hp-volunteer-track.revealed .hp-hcard:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 0.16s; }

        /* Volunteer cards are wider — only two, act as feature tiles. They are <button>s
           that open registration modals, so reset native button chrome to match .hp-hcard. */
        .hp-volunteer-track .hp-hcard {
            width: min(86vw, 460px);
            font: inherit;
            text-align: right;
            cursor: pointer;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        .hp-volunteer-track .hp-hcard-cta {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-top: 0.6rem;
            font-size: 0.84rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
            padding-bottom: 2px;
            align-self: flex-start;
            transition: color var(--dur-fast, 180ms) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-fast, 180ms) var(--ease-out);
        }
        .hp-volunteer-track .hp-hcard:hover .hp-hcard-cta {
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            border-color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
        }
        .hp-volunteer-track .hp-hcard-cta i { font-size: 0.7rem; }

        /* Scroll progress bar */
        .hp-volunteer-progress {
            position: relative;
            height: 2px;
            margin: 0 0.2rem;
            background: rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.07);
            border-radius: 2px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .hp-volunteer-progress-fill {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; right: 0;
            height: 100%;
            width: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--c-gold, #b8883e), var(--c-gold-soft, #d4a855));
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: width 0.25s var(--ease-out, ease);
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .hp-volunteer-track-wrap { margin: 0 -1.1rem 0; padding: 0 1.1rem; }
            .hp-volunteer-track .hp-hcard { width: 86vw; }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .hp-volunteer-track .hp-hcard {
                transition: none !important;
                transform: none !important;
                opacity: 1 !important;
            }
        }

        .hp-final-cta {
            margin: 0 0 2rem;
            padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
            position: relative;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hp-final-cta::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; right: 0; left: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg,
                transparent 0%,
                var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08)) 20%,
                var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08)) 50%,
                var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08)) 80%,
                transparent 100%);
        }

        .hp-final-cta-ornament-center {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .hp-final-cta-eyebrow {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.6rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.26em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
            display: block;
        }

        .hp-final-cta-title {
            font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            line-height: 1.25;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .hp-final-cta-sub {
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            line-height: 1.9;
            color: var(--c-text-secondary, #5a5650);
            font-weight: 300;
            max-width: 420px;
            margin: 0 auto 2.8rem;
        }

        .hp-final-cta-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.7rem;
            background: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            color: var(--c-surface, #ffffff);
            padding: 0.9rem 2.4rem;
            border-radius: var(--r-sm, 10px);
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-family: 'Almarai', sans-serif;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out), transform var(--dur-fast, 180ms) var(--ease-out);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        .hp-final-cta-btn:hover {
            background: var(--c-text-secondary, #5a5650);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hp-final-cta { padding: 3.5rem 0 3rem; }
            .hp-final-cta-title { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 5.5vw, 2rem); }
            .hp-final-cta-sub { font-size: 0.9rem; }
        }

        /* ========== SCROLL REVEAL ========== */
        [data-reveal] {
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
                        transform 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
        }

        [data-reveal="right"] { transform: translateX(-28px); }
        [data-reveal="up"]    { transform: translateY(28px); }

        [data-reveal].revealed {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: none;
        }

        /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
           MOBILE LETTER-SPACING  (≤ 768px)
           Reduces excessive character gaps on small screens.
           Desktop appearance is unchanged.
        ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-eyebrow          { letter-spacing: 0.10em; }
            .hero-meta-label       { letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
            .hero-year-stamp       { letter-spacing: 0.09em; }
            .vm-header-eyebrow     { letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
            .vm-tag                { letter-spacing: 0.09em; }
            .vm-pullquote cite     { letter-spacing: 0.07em; }
            .hp-acts-eyebrow       { letter-spacing: 0.11em; }
            .hp-act-card-num       { letter-spacing: 0.09em; }
            .hp-act-card-tag       { letter-spacing: 0.09em; }
            .hp-heritage-eyebrow   { letter-spacing: 0.11em; }
            .hp-heritage-card-num  { letter-spacing: 0.09em; }
            .hp-heritage-card-tag  { letter-spacing: 0.09em; }
            .hp-volunteer-eyebrow  { letter-spacing: 0.11em; }
            .hp-volunteer-card-tag { letter-spacing: 0.09em; }
            .hp-final-cta-eyebrow  { letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
            .hp-news-eyebrow       { letter-spacing: 0.11em; }
            .hp-news-card-date     { letter-spacing: 0.07em; }
        }

        /* ========== HOMEPAGE NEWS PREVIEW ========== */
        .hp-news-preview {
            margin: 0 0 5rem;
            position: relative;
            padding-top: 5rem;
        }

        .hp-news-preview::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; right: 0; left: 0;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg,
                transparent 0%,
                rgba(192,154,98,0.2) 20%,
                rgba(192,154,98,0.45) 50%,
                rgba(192,154,98,0.2) 80%,
                transparent 100%);
        }

        .hp-news-header {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .hp-news-eyebrow-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
        }

        .hp-news-eyebrow {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.6rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.24em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #a07848;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .hp-news-rule {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 100px;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(192,154,98,0.5), transparent);
        }

        .hp-news-diamond {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background: #c09a62;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .hp-news-title {
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .hp-news-title::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            right: 0;
            width: 50px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
        }

        .hp-news-desc {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.9;
            color: var(--c-text-secondary, #5a5650);
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-top: 1.4rem;
            max-width: 520px;
        }

        /* Two-card grid for news preview */
        .hp-news-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
        }

        /* News card — editorial minimal style */
        .hp-news-card {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            background: var(--c-surface, #ffffff);
            border: 1px solid var(--c-border, rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.08));
            border-radius: var(--r-md, 16px);
            overflow: hidden;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            transition: transform var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-spring),
                        box-shadow var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-spring),
                        border-color var(--dur-base, 280ms) var(--ease-out);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .hp-news-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            border-color: var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        /* Image wrapper — elegant proportions */
        .hp-news-card-img-wrap {
            position: relative;
            aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #1e1208;
        }

        /* Elegant inset frame on image */
        .hp-news-card-img-wrap::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 10px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(192,154,98,0.18);
            border-radius: 8px;
            z-index: 3;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .hp-news-card:hover .hp-news-card-img-wrap::before {
            border-color: rgba(192,154,98,0.38);
        }

        .hp-news-card-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            transition: transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1);
        }

        .hp-news-card:hover .hp-news-card-img {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        /* Soft gradient overlay on image */
        .hp-news-card-img-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to top,
                rgba(12,7,2,0.38) 0%,
                transparent 55%);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        /* Placeholder when no image */
        .hp-news-card-img-placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2a1c0e 0%, #3d2810 50%, #2a1c0e 100%);
            gap: 0.8rem;
        }

        .hp-news-card-img-placeholder i {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: rgba(192,154,98,0.45);
        }

        .hp-news-card-img-placeholder span {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.58rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(192,154,98,0.35);
        }

        /* Card body */
        .hp-news-card-body {
            padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem 1.8rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.55rem;
            flex: 1;
        }

        /* Date & category row */
        .hp-news-card-meta {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.9rem;
        }

        .hp-news-card-date {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.6rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.16em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #a07848;
        }

        .hp-news-card-meta-dot {
            width: 3px;
            height: 3px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(192,154,98,0.5);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .hp-news-card-category {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.6rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #b07a3c;
        }

        /* Title */
        .hp-news-card-name {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #1e1610;
            letter-spacing: -0.015em;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        /* Excerpt */
        .hp-news-card-excerpt {
            font-size: 0.87rem;
            line-height: 1.85;
            color: #6b4f35;
            font-weight: 300;
            flex: 1;
        }

        /* Divider line above link */
        .hp-news-card-divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(192,154,98,0.2), transparent);
            margin-top: 0.4rem;
        }

        /* Read more link */
        .hp-news-card-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--c-gold, #b8883e);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-gold-line, rgba(184, 136, 62, 0.30));
            padding-bottom: 2px;
            align-self: flex-start;
            transition: color var(--dur-fast, 180ms) var(--ease-out), border-color var(--dur-fast, 180ms) var(--ease-out);
        }

        .hp-news-card:hover .hp-news-card-link {
            color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
            border-color: var(--c-text-primary, #1c1a17);
        }

        .hp-news-card-link i { font-size: 0.7rem; }

        .hp-news-cta-row {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .hp-news-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.4rem; }
            .hp-news-card-name { font-size: 1.05rem; }
            .hp-news-card-excerpt { font-size: 0.84rem; }
        }
    </style>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="design-system.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="maintenance.css">
    <script>document.documentElement.className+=" mnt-checking";window.__mntFailsafe=setTimeout(function(){document.documentElement.classList.remove("mnt-checking");},3500);</script>
</head>
<body>
<div class="site-wrapper">

    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════
         NAVIGATION
    ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <nav class="nav-container" aria-label="التنقل الرئيسي">
        <div class="logo-area-nav">
            <!-- Real Association Logo -->
            <img
                src="assets/الشعار/الشعار.png"
                alt="شعار جمعية إرث وحضارة بالقريات"
                class="nav-logo-img"
                loading="eager"
            >
            <span class="association-name-nav">جمعية إرث وحضارة بالقريات</span>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="index.html">الرئيسية</a>
            <a href="activities.html">الفعاليات</a>
            <a href="heritage-crafts.html">التراث والحرف</a>
            <a href="volunteer.html">التطوع</a>
            <a href="news.html">الأخبار</a>
            <a href="partnerships.html">الشراكات</a>
            <a href="reports.html">الحوكمة</a>
            <a href="board.html">مجلس الإدارة</a>
            <a href="contact.html">اتصل بنا</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════
         HERO SECTION — CINEMATIC EDITORIAL
    ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <div class="hero-wrapper">

        <!-- ── LEFT: EDITORIAL TEXT PANEL ── -->
        <div class="hero-editorial-text">

            <!-- Top ornament rule -->
            <div class="hero-ornament-line">
                <div class="hero-ornament-diamond"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Eyebrow label -->
            <span class="hero-eyebrow">القريات · منطقة الجوف · المملكة العربية السعودية</span>

            <!-- Main headline -->
            <h1 class="hero-title">
                إرثٌ نعتز به
                <em>وحضارةٌ نواصل بناءها</em>
            </h1>

            <!-- Subtext -->
            <p class="hero-sub">
                جمعية ثقافية غير ربحية تُعنى بحفظ التراث والموروث الوطني وتعزيز الهوية الثقافية في القريات  .
            </p>

            <!-- CTA Row -->
            <div class="hero-cta-group">
                <a href="activities.html" class="hero-cta-primary">
                    استكشف الفعاليات
                    <i class="fas fa-arrow-left" style="font-size: 0.78rem;"></i>
                </a>
                <a href="heritage-crafts.html" class="hero-cta-secondary">التراث والحرف</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Bottom meta strip (kept empty, clean) -->
            <div class="hero-meta-strip"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- ── RIGHT: VISUAL PANEL ── -->
        <div class="hero-visual-panel">

            <!-- Premium hero image with sophisticated overlay -->
            <div class="hero-visual-bg">
                <img
                    src="assets/Hero/Hero.png"
                    alt="الموقع الرسمي لجمعية إرث وحضارة بالقريات"
                    class="hero-image"
                    loading="eager"
                    decoding="async"
                >
            </div>

            <!-- Heritage arabesque frame overlay (corners) -->
            <div class="hero-frame-overlay">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
                    <path d="M92,4 L96,4 L96,8" fill="none" stroke="#d4a96a" stroke-width="0.5"/>
                    <path d="M96,92 L96,96 L92,96" fill="none" stroke="#d4a96a" stroke-width="0.5"/>
                    <path d="M4,96 L4,96 L8,96" fill="none" stroke="#d4a96a" stroke-width="0.5"/>
                    <path d="M4,4 L4,8" fill="none" stroke="#d4a96a" stroke-width="0.5"/>
                    <path d="M4,4 L8,4" fill="none" stroke="#d4a96a" stroke-width="0.5"/>
                </svg>
            </div>

            <!-- Year stamp running vertically -->

        </div><!-- /.hero-visual-panel -->

    </div><!-- /.hero-wrapper -->

    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         NEWS PREVIEW — آخر الأخبار (Firebase-driven, auto-hides when empty)
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="hp-news-preview" id="hpNewsSection" style="display:none">

        <!-- Section header -->
        <div class="hp-news-header" data-reveal="up">
            <div class="hp-news-eyebrow-row">
                <span class="hp-news-eyebrow">News & Updates · الأخبار والمستجدات</span>
                <div class="hp-news-rule"></div>
                <div class="hp-news-diamond"></div>
            </div>
            <h2 class="hp-news-title">آخر الأخبار</h2>
            <p class="hp-news-desc">آخر المستجدات والأنشطة والمبادرات الخاصة بجمعية إرث وحضارة.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Populated by Firebase -->
        <div class="hp-news-grid" data-reveal="up" id="hpNewsGrid"></div>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <div class="hp-news-cta-row">
            <a href="news.html" class="btn-heritage">
                عرض جميع الأخبار
                <i class="fas fa-chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </a>
        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════
         VISION & MISSION — PREMIUM EDITORIAL
    ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="vm-section">

        <!-- Section header -->
        <div class="vm-header">
            <span class="vm-header-eyebrow">الهوية المؤسسية</span>
            <div class="vm-header-diamond"></div>
            <div class="vm-header-rule"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Two-panel editorial grid -->
        <div class="vm-grid">

            <!-- ── PANEL 1: الرؤية ── -->
            <div class="vm-panel">
                <div class="vm-panel-numeral">١</div>
                <h2 class="vm-title">الرؤية</h2>
                <p class="vm-body">
                    أن تكون الجمعية مرجعاً رائداً في حفظ وتوثيق التراث الثقافي والحضاري المحلي وأن تساهم في نشر الوعي بالتراث الوطني وإبرازه من خلال الأنشطة الثقافية والتعليمية والمشاركة المجتمعية.
                </p>
                <div class="vm-panel-ornament">
                    <div class="vm-panel-ornament-dot"></div>
                    <div class="vm-panel-ornament-dot"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ── PANEL 2: الرسالة ── -->
            <div class="vm-panel">
                <div class="vm-panel-numeral">٢</div>
                <h2 class="vm-title">الرسالة</h2>
                <p class="vm-body">
                    العمل على المحافظة على التراث الثقافي والحضاري المحلي ونشره بين الأجيال الجديدة والجمهور بشكل عام من خلال الفعاليات الثقافية والتدريب على الحرف التقليدية وتمكين المستهدفين بامتلاك مهنة تكون مصدر رزق لهم وكذلك البحث وتوفير مصادر علمية ذات مرجعية في مجال التراث والموروث الوطني.
                </p>
                <div class="vm-panel-ornament">
                    <div class="vm-panel-ornament-dot"></div>
                    <div class="vm-panel-ornament-dot"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div><!-- /.vm-grid -->
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════
         OBJECTIVES — الأهداف
    ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="obj-section">

        <div class="obj-header">
            <span class="obj-header-eyebrow">Objectives · الأهداف</span>
            <div class="obj-header-diamond"></div>
            <div class="obj-header-rule"></div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="obj-heading">أهداف الجمعية</h2>

        <div class="obj-grid">

            <div class="obj-item">
                <div class="obj-numeral">١</div>
                <div class="obj-badge">١</div>
                <p class="obj-text">المساعدة في توفير فرص الاحتراف لأصحاب المواهب</p>
                <div class="obj-foot"><div class="obj-foot-dot"></div><div class="obj-foot-dot"></div></div>
